# 公理:D18:擋面參照 t<角材id> 指名已放角材的側面。
# GEO-101:R21 between 明寫兩端。與 _edge_stop_ambiguous.scene 同一個幾何,
# 差別只在副支 2 改用 between 指名兩支主支的側面,而不是靠 auto 自己找。
# 預期長度與 auto 版完全相同:1960。
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 0,0 2000,0 2000,1000 4000,1000 4000,3000 0,3000
grid 1 on 1 u 3000
timber 1 1000 20 20 role primary
timber 2 20 20 role secondary
timber 3 20 20 role boundary
timber 4 20 20 role boundary
timber 5 3946 20 20 role primary
place 3 on 1 at-edge e5 +v +n
place 4 on 1 at-edge e3 +v +n
place 1 on 1 at 2500 1000 +u +n
place 5 on 1 at 27 2980 +u +n
place 2 on 1 at-grid 1 u 0 between t1 t5 +v +n
